;
ENDING A CALL

Type BYE at the CP/M prompt to log off normally.
Exit an active game or the bulletin board before typing BYE.
Files in I0:WORK are cleared when the call ends.
The bulletin board's persistent account and messages are retained.

Type MESSAGE at the CP/M prompt to leave a message for the sysop.
Follow its prompts; this is separate from messages posted in RBBS.
Your terminal client's disconnect operation also ends the connection.
